<%#
  The end of the run, kept on the transcript.

  The runner this replaced swapped the page for a "Run complete" card, throwing
  away the thing the agent had just been reading. Here the answered steps stay
  where they are and this sits under them; the results page is a link rather
  than a destination the runner forces you to.

  locals: results_url
%>
<div class="runner-thread__complete">
  <p class="text-sm">This run is complete.</p>
  <%= link_to "View results", results_url, class: "btn btn--secondary btn--sm" %>
</div>
